          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot omiyo Lakic i ciŋ jo Icrael ci Yocwa omako woko i nino me aryone, oneko jo Lakic woko ki pala lucwan, dano ma tye iye ducu, kit ma nene otimo i kom Libna-ni.",
