          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omako luker-ru ducu ki lobogi ducu lawaŋacel, pien Rwot Lubaŋa pa Icrael aye noŋo obedo ka lweny pi Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
